# Bundle only what the server needs at runtime.
#
# node_modules is filtered with the gitignore "exclude contents, re-include
# specific entries" idiom: `/node_modules/*` excludes each entry individually
# (not the parent directory), which is what makes the `!` negations below
# work. Excluding `/node_modules/` outright would make them impossible.
#
# The negations must NOT end in "/": mcpb prunes ignored directories during
# its walk, so a directory-only pattern never matches the entry being pruned
# and the re-include silently fails (shipping a bundle with no dependencies).
#
# Runtime deps are only @modelcontextprotocol/server (+ its @…/core) and zod;
# everything else here is dev-only (typescript, wrangler, mcpb CLI).
/node_modules/*
!/node_modules/@modelcontextprotocol
!/node_modules/zod

# Source and dev config — dist/ is what actually runs.
/src/
/tsconfig.json
/wrangler.toml
/RESEARCH.md
/google-tasks.mcpb
